              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "karishma"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I suggest thawing the frozen strawberries a little [otherwise it takes forever to blend them, I know because I'm speaking from experience]. I also made it 1 cup of rum, it just tasted virgin without the extra half cup. Otherwise this recipe is pretty delicious! I also recommend making the cream from scratch, it just makes it even better, and then swirl it into the drink versus just on top! :]"
